OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACollege 'deeply saddened' by
OL,4,Apupils' river deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bodies of two teenage boys and a
OL,7,Fteenage girl were recovered from the
OL,8,Fwater the same day. A boy, 17, who
OL,9,Fmanaged to reach safety, has been
OL,10,Freleased from hospital and arrested on
OL,11,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,12,Fdriving. He remains in police custody.
OL,14,FSunderland College said it was "deeply
OL,15,Fsaddened" by the deaths and offered
OL,16,Fcondolences to the students' families
OL,17,Fand friends.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
